		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Twisting, serpentine wingless drake. Scales glimmer with light of the moon and stars.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 59, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 rend +7 (2d8) or 1 lightning breath or 1 thunderstorm, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Imperious</strong>. Lightning immune. Shapechange and assume the form of a humanoid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lightning Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. DEX 15+ or 3d8 damage (DISADV on check if wearing metal armor).</p><p></p><p><strong>Thunderstorm</strong>. Hurricane winds for 1d6 rounds. Ranged weapons are useless, flying enemies STR 15+ or crash.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
